                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The tubing that carries gasoline in a vehicle from the gas tank to the engine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dcb869e-cf0a-44d6-865c-d1d44c4724e5",
                                                "sense_id": "bda710c9-fe4e-3a8c-a616-e7d7f8e22c32",
                                                "text": "On older models, the gas line feeds the carburetor and has a replaceable fuel filter."
